FILE: EOS-Data/FEOS_Material-DB.dat 7723 bytes
   1|%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
   2|%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%% FEOS material properties database %%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
   3|%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%% version: 2016-07-29 %%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
   4|%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
   5|% This file contains the FEOS material properties database.            %
   6|% To add a new material, introduce a new section with an unused FEOS   %
   7|% material number. Allowed numbers are: 1000-9999                      %
   8|% The material number comes before each parameter in squared brackets. %
   9|%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
  10|% The following properties have to be specified for each material:     %
  11|% - SESAME-Number: SESAME table number (if not known, set to 1000)     %
  12|% - Treference: Reference temperature in eV                            %
  13|% - Rhoreference: Density at Treference and zero pressure in g/cm^3    %
  14|% - Buld-Modulus: Bulkmodulus at Treference, Rreference in dyne/cm^2   %
  15|% - Number-of-Elements: Number of elements included in the material    %
  16|% - A[1...Element-Number]: Atomic weights of all included elements     %
  17|% - Z[1...Element-Number]: Atomic numbers of all included elements     %
  18|% - X[1...Element-Number]: Number of atoms per molecule                %
  19|%                          of all included elements                    %
  20|%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
  21|% If you want to use the soft-sphere function, please specify also:    %
  22|% - Ecohesive: Cohesive energy / enthalphy of sublimation in erg/g     %
  23|% - Soft-Sphere-m: Parameter m in soft-sphere function                 %
  24|% - Soft-Sphere-n: Parameter n in soft-sphere function                 %
  25|%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
 ...
